<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Florida 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$289,250 U.S. Men's Clay Court Championships on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>6-7 (3-7) 7-5</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 3-Petr Korda (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>5-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>7-Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Dennis van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 7-6 (8-6) 3-6 6-3</p>
</text>
